Package: newameRica
Title: New America Data Visualization Theme for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("New America - Design Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "design@newamerica.org")
Description: A ggplot2 theme and color palette system implementing New America's
    brand guidelines for data visualization. Provides a base theme, categorical
    and sequential color palettes, and a save function with New America export
    defaults. Uses Chivo (available from Google Fonts) by default; users with
    Whyte (by ABC Dinamo) installed can switch via na_register_fonts("whyte").
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    ragg,
    systemfonts
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
